The Twilight Forest (code)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GloamingForest reproduces The Twilight Forest 4.8 for Minecraft 1.21.1
(https://github.com/TeamTwilight/twilightforest, branch 1.21.1, commit
9e40a75721c716b2fdf80c16d1058fe718825e9f).

  The Twilight Forest
  Copyright (c) 2012-2017 Ben Mazur / Benimatic, and the TeamTwilight contributors

  This library is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the
  GNU Lesser General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version
  2.1 of the License, or (at your option) any later version.

Parts of GloamingForest are translations of The Twilight Forest's Java source code into C++, made
under that licence's "or any later version" option and distributed under LGPL-3.0-or-later. Every
translated file starts with an attribution header naming the TF source file(s) it was translated
from (see AGENTS.md, "Licences and attribution").

