The Twilight Forest (assets)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The textures, models, blockstates and language files of The Twilight Forest that GloamingForest
reuses (imported by tools/import into assets/gen/import and the released resource packs) are
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/); see assets/LICENSE.

  Original assets: The Twilight Forest by TeamTwilight (https://github.com/TeamTwilight/twilightforest).
  Changes: converted to Minecraft: Bedrock Edition formats (block geometry, entity geometry, texture
  atlases, .lang files for the Bedrock locales), partitioned per feature.

These assets, and any resource pack that contains them, may be shared and adapted only for
non-commercial purposes, with attribution, and under the same licence.

The sounds, music and structure templates (.nbt) of The Twilight Forest are All Rights Reserved.
GloamingForest does not contain, open, decode or derive from them: every sound and music track is
an original synthesized work (tools/sounds) and every structure template is an original design in
GloamingForest's template format (tools/structures). A CI guard (tools/ci/arr-guard.ps1) rejects
any file identical to one of them.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Levitate
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The foundation of GloamingForest (module system, configs and config screen, commands, selftests,
world storage, pack deployment, companion protocol, interactions, block data, redstone, screens,
build scripts, assemble, e2e harnesses and CI) is adapted from Levitate v0.1.0
(https://github.com/LiteLDev/Levitate), Copyright (c) LiteLDev and the Levitate contributors,
licensed under LGPL-3.0-or-later. Adapted files say so in their first line. The e2e client world
fixture (tools/e2e/client/fixtures/GF-Test/level.dat) was built from Levitate's fixture.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
