-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tools and runtime
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LeviLamina (https://github.com/LiteLDev/LeviLamina, LGPL-3.0) is the mod loader GloamingForest
builds against. BeDD (https://github.com/LiteLDev/BeDD, LGPL-3.0) drives the game client in the
end-to-end tests; it is downloaded by the test harness and not distributed with GloamingForest.
